{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "gymbro-api-collection",
    "name": "GymBro API",
    "description": "Health + auth (SUPER / STAFF / MEMBER) + tenants CRUD (Super).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Importá esta colección y `GymBro.local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Arriba a la derecha: environment **GymBro Local** (obligatorio).\n3. Seed: `docker compose exec api npm run prisma:seed`.\n\n**Runner (secuencia)**\nCorrer la carpeta `Auth flow (Collection Runner)` con Run. Los scripts guardan tokens y encadenan Login → Me → Refresh → Me → Logout.\n\n**Tenants**\nLogin Super (manual) → carpeta `Tenants (Super)`.\n\n**Credenciales seed (también en el environment)**\n- Super: `super@gymbro.local` / `ChangeMe123!`\n- Staff: `admin@demo.gym` / `ChangeMe123!` + tenantId\n- Member: `socio@demo.gym` / `ChangeMe123!` + tenantId",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Asegura baseUrl aunque no haya environment seleccionado",
          "if (!pm.environment.get('baseUrl') && !pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('baseUrl', 'http://localhost:3001');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "profileType", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userEmail", "value": "" },
    { "key": "createdTenantId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('database up', () => pm.expect(body.database).to.eql('up'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth flow (Collection Runner)",
      "description": "Usá Run folder. Secuencia: Login Super → Me → Refresh → Me (post-refresh) → Logout.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Login Super",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('profile SUPER', () => pm.expect(body.profileType).to.eql('SUPER'));",
                  "",
                  "function setVar(key, value) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(key, value);",
                  "  pm.environment.set(key, value);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "setVar('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "setVar('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "setVar('profileType', body.profileType);",
                  "setVar('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "setVar('userEmail', body.user.email);",
                  "",
                  "console.log('Saved tokens for', body.profileType, body.user.email);",
                  "postman.setNextRequest('2. Me');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{superEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{superPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/super/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Me",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const token = pm.environment.get('accessToken') || pm.collectionVariables.get('accessToken');",
                  "if (!token) {",
                  "  throw new Error('accessToken vacío: corré Login antes o seleccioná environment GymBro Local');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const expected = pm.environment.get('profileType') || pm.collectionVariables.get('profileType');",
                  "pm.test('profile matches', () => pm.expect(body.profileType).to.eql(expected));",
                  "if (expected === 'STAFF' || expected === 'MEMBER') {",
                  "  pm.test('has tenantId', () => pm.expect(body.tenantId).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "  pm.environment.set('tenantIdFromMe', body.tenantId);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tenantIdFromMe', body.tenantId);",
                  "}",
                  "postman.setNextRequest('3. Refresh');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const refresh = pm.environment.get('refreshToken') || pm.collectionVariables.get('refreshToken');",
                  "if (!refresh) {",
                  "  throw new Error('refreshToken vacío: corré Login antes');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "function setVar(key, value) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(key, value);",
                  "  pm.environment.set(key, value);",
                  "}",
                  "setVar('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "setVar('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "setVar('profileType', body.profileType);",
                  "console.log('Rotated tokens');",
                  "postman.setNextRequest('4. Me after refresh');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Me after refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "postman.setNextRequest('5. Logout');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('ok', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().ok).to.eql(true));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.unset('accessToken');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.unset('refreshToken');",
                  "pm.environment.unset('accessToken');",
                  "pm.environment.unset('refreshToken');",
                  "postman.setNextRequest(null);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
